Subject: [PATCH 84/93] flashnext cuda: a drafted round's n-gram rows read
 during its chain (TF_FLASHNEXT_PLE_EARLY), --pp 2's verify head split between
 the stages (TF_FLASHNEXT_PP_HEAD_SPLIT), and the gather start and pick copy
 off the GPU's path (TF_FLASHNEXT_ROUND_TURN)

